// lexdb over TDS: the audit's missing T-SQL functions, checked against SQL Server 2025 (generated by tests/lexdb/gen_mssql.py
// --port 14331 --container lxl-mssql25 newfn from mssql_newfn_queries.txt; design/lexdb-new-features.md S7, S12-S14, S16, S17):
