// (url_safe) and BASE64_DECODE (either alphabet, padding optional; 9803, 8116), UNISTR (\xxxx, \+xxxxxx, another escape; 9844),
// EDIT_DISTANCE (its maximum), EDIT_DISTANCE_SIMILARITY, JARO_WINKLER_DISTANCE and JARO_WINKLER_SIMILARITY (9847 under an SQL_
// collation, 8116, 174), PRODUCT (int, bigint, float, decimal, money, DISTINCT, OVER, groups, empty input, 8115, 8117). Each batch
// runs against lexdb with SET lexdb_batch = off and on: "same: " and the answer, or DIFFERENT and both.
